<tr><td>Date-stamped photos and video</td><td>Shows hail size, roof condition, and damage before repairs or tarping.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Weather records (NOAA, NWS)</td><td>Helps confirm hail fell at or near the property on the date of loss.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Roof inspection report with test squares</td><td>Records hits per square, mat fractures, and functional damage.</td></tr>
